title: AskTechnician
---
<<declare $receivedCrowbar = false>>
<<declare $isHappy = false>>
<<declare $hasCokeCan = false>>
<<declare $lookedDrain = false>>
Fred: Hello
<<if $isHappy == true>>
    <<jump Happy>>
<<elseif $hasCokeCan == true>>
    <<jump OfferCoke>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Angry>>
<<endif>>
===

title: Angry
---
-> Can you help me ...
    <<jump AngryAnswer>>
===

title: AngryAnswer
---
Technician: Allways people want me to help them!
Technician: Not anymore! I'm busy right now
===


title: OfferCoke
---
-> Can you help me ...
    <<jump AngryAnswer>>
-> Can you help me open a drain? <<if $lookedDrain == true and $receivedCrowbar == false>>
-> You look thirsty, Do you want some coke?
    Technician: Hey thanks.
    <<set $hasCokeCan to false>>
    <<set $isHappy to true>>
===


title: Happy
---
-> Can you help me ...
    <<jump Questions>>
===

title: Questions
---
-> Nothing really.
    <<jump Bye>>
-> Can you help me open a drain? <<if $lookedDrain == true and $receivedCrowbar == false>>
    <<jump Drain>>
===

title: Drain
---
Technician: I can give you this crowbar.
Fred: Thanks, that can help
<<set $receivedCrowbar to true>>
<<jump Bye>>
===


title: Bye
---
Technician: Ok.
Fred: Bye.
===
